&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ms-outlook-mobile-reference-message skipProofing&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Production&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;ms-outlook-mobile-reference-message skipProofing&quot;&gt;We are WPP Production - the unified global production company that brings together all of WPP&#39;s content producers, studios and craft experts into one connected organisation. We combine world-class human craft with next generation technology to originate, design, and deliver multi-channel content systems at scale. Built for borderless collaboration and powered by deep craft expertise, we are the production engine designed for today&#39;s always on, AI driven marketing world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel&amp;nbsp;in a single company –&amp;nbsp;powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open,&amp;nbsp;to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__http://wpp.com/__;!!JboVxjCXSME!N9KGoZIn5nCC-uOWhEdE-ChrrJuf6TgkLzNNkLaW9BExJsVqZZ_hMSmGbARJ0tdBOnKYM7kEbv5L3ncUpg7-6uEPNdY$&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;6ded86b6-cde3-4e48-958d-34727f881edd&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Hybrid working model&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What does a Business Director &amp;nbsp;do at WPP Production?&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Production requires an experienced Business Director to lead an exciting global account in the luxury / optical sector through a period of positive transformation.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate will bring a proven track record of winning new business, strong relationship-building and team leadership skills, and the gravitas and credibility to inspire confidence across clients and colleagues alike.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll focus on implementing more automated, agile and technology-enabled production processes while ensuring uninterrupted delivery of the existing scope.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;You’ll optimise ways of working, revise commercial models, and introduce + implement new technologies that meet client needs by partnering with commercial, operations, language, QC, and martech teams to deliver innovative solutions that guarantee client satisfaction for years to come.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with commercial, ops, and solution design teams to shape practical proposals that improve account sustainability and increased value for the client (perceived and concrete / tangible)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead&amp;nbsp;the account’s transformation to deliver more automated, nimble, agile, cost effective, and technology-enabled production solutions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess current processes and ways of working, identify opportunities to improve efficiency and quality, and develop a clear plan for change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain uninterrupted, high-quality delivery of the existing scope throughout the transformation, while simultaneously demonstrating consistent and rapid progression toward new and improved capabilities and ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with client stakeholders and internal teams, aligning priorities and maintaining confidence throughout periods of change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, motivate and develop the account team, creating clarity around roles, priorities and expected outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record as a Business Director / experienced Senior Account Director in an integrated or production agency environment (or equivalent)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable experience of successfully leading and securing scope extensions and responding to complex RFPs / client pitches to secure new business wins&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading business or operational transformation across production processes, workflow management, automation, and AI-powered asset creation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to optimise processes and ways of working while maintaining reliable day-to-day delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing senior client relationships and successfully influencing a range of internal and external stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of leading and developing high-performing, multidisciplinary teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Persona profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal, communication, problem-solving, commercial, influencing, and negotiation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A true relationship builder who is able to inspire confidence, build trust, and handle difficult conversations with tact, diplomacy, empathy, and positivity to drive satisfactory outcomes for all parties&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A professional, calm, approachable demeanour that brims with gravitas&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to thrive in a dynamic, highly matrixed agency environment &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic and action-oriented, with the drive and capability to convert ideas and conversations into clear, achievable actions and outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resilient, adaptable and composed when managing competing priorities or uncertainty. Able to navigate ambiguity and make informed decisions based on sound business acumen and experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of production, creative development, localization, and quality assurance processes across key channels including print, digital, video, social, broadcast, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear understanding of international brand challenges and requirements and the marketing technology landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
